'''The Horny Boys''' are a [[boss]] added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Repentance]]'' that can appear in {{s|Gehenna}}.
__TOC__
== Behavior ==
Floats randomly around the room and cycles between the following attacks in the following order:
* Summons a {{e|Boom Fly}} orbited by 3 pink {{e|Eternal Fly Bomb}}s.
* Juggles 3 bombs then throws them toward Isaac. Each bomb has a chance of having the {{i|Hot Bombs}} or {{i|Sad Bombs}} effect.
* Chains together numerous consecutive tear patterns while gradually increasing the rate in which they are fired:
** 4 cardinal projectiles.
** 4 diagonal projectiles.
** 4 cardinal projectiles.
** 8 projectiles in all directions.
** 12 projectiles in all directions.
** 8 clusters in all directions, each contains 3 projectiles.
** 10 projectiles in all directions, rotating counterclockwise.
** 10 projectiles in all directions, rotating clockwise.
** 4 diagonal projectiles.
** 4 cardinal spreads, each contains 3 projectiles.
** 4 diagonal spreads, each contains 3 projectiles.
** 8 projectiles in all directions.
** 4 diagonal spreads, each contains 5 projectiles.
** 10 projectiles in all directions.
** 8 projectiles in all directions.
** 12 projectiles in all directions.
** 12 projectiles in all directions.
** 4 cardinal projectiles.
** 4 diagonal projectiles.
** This attack ends with Hornfel getting sick and vomiting out 3 fireballs that each extend in cardinal directions upon landing.
* Teleports 3 times and throws out a short delay {{i|Brimstone Bombs}} Bomb each time.
'''OR'''
* Throws a {{i|Sad Bombs}} Bomb at their feet to create a smokescreen before rapidly teleporting to another location. This attack is repeated 5 times.

== Trivia ==
* They appear to be a conjoining of {{e|Hornfel}} and {{e|Loki}}.
** Furthering this concept is that they appear to share attacks from both bosses.
** Additionally, using {{i|Meat Cleaver}} against them splits them into their individual entities.
*** Hornfel as a result, is in his 2nd phase, where he cries and attempts to retreat from Isaac, similar to when Isaac breaks his minecart as a {{s|Mines}} boss. He is unable to leave the boss room and may even step onto the spikes present in one of the boss arenas.
*** Hornfel will only drop bomb pickups/items if Loki was killed first.
** Their name in the boss VS screen also shows a bomb and a mark, representing both bosses.
* In the [[Bestiary Repentance|Bestiary]], they are referred to as "Horny Boys".
* According to Edmund, Hornfel and Loki are brothers.<ref>https://twitter.com/edmundmcmillen/status/1491311684144697345?t=HIqu902V3aUtJqXMP5Oz8A&s=19</ref>
* Their name may refer to the term used for being sexually aroused, being "horny".
* They are called "Horni Bois" in the game files.

